OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FTuesday will be a dry day with
OL,6,Fareas of low cloud and hill fog
OL,7,Flifting and breaking during the
OL,8,Fmorning, to allow very warm spells of
OL,9,Fsunshine to develop for the afternoon.
OL,10,FBreezy at first, but winds soon
OL,11,Ffalling light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine end to the day with
OL,14,Fsome evening sunshine. Clear spells
OL,15,Fovernight, though some areas of low
OL,16,Fcloud will reform, giving some hill
OL,17,Ffog. Another warm night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
