OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWednesday looks fine. Early
OL,6,Flow cloud and hill fog clearing to
OL,7,Fleave plenty of sunshine. However,
OL,8,Ffurther cloud edging in from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest during the day. Hot and
OL,10,Ffeeling humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FThursday will be fresher with sunshine
OL,14,Fand perhaps the odd shower. Mostly dry
OL,15,Fon Friday and Saturday with further
OL,16,Fsunshine developing at times. Still
OL,17,Fwarm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
